title: Rotfrontkampferbund
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: reichsbanner_timer <= 0
card-image: img/reichsbanner.jpg
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; reichsbanner_timer += 6; rfb_militarization_cost = 2 if rfb_militancy > 0.1 else rfb_militarization_cost = 1; rfb_militarization_cost = 3 if rfb_militancy > 0.25
max-visits: 6
#subtitle: Protecting the friend, Fighting off the enemy.

= Reichsbanner

The *Rotfrontkampferbund* is a mass organization of the working class, tasked with serving in the defense of unions halls, party chapters, and rallies. Many of its members are veterans of the Great War, and many more are not even KPD members. The most loyal members are highly disciplined, and ready to take the fight to the fascsits in the streets. 

[? if workers_kpd < 46 or workers_kpd < workers_nsdap or workers_kpd < workers_spd : The Rotfrontkampferbund is having more difficult time recruiting, as the KPD is not the dominant party among the workers. ?]

- @militant: Fund more military-style training and equipment for the Reichsbanner.
- @militant_2: Use our existing resources to support more training for the Reichsbanner.
- @same: Keep the Reichsbanner as it is.
- @cut_rfb: Cut funding for the Reichsbanner.
- @women_rfb
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

#- Orient reichsbanner towards anti-fascism (only available if we have prioritized anti fascism)

@militant
choose-if: resources >= rfb_militarization_cost
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources ([+ rfb_militarization_cost +] needed).
subtitle: -[+ rfb_militarization_cost +] resources
on-arrival: resources -= rfb_militarization_cost; rfb_investment += 1; rfb_strength += 100; rfb_militancy += 0.05; thalmannites_strength += 2; ultras_strength += 3; thalmannites_dissent -= 2; ultras_dissent -= 5; kpd_militancy += 0.05; workers_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_kpd += 3*(1-dissent);

Some in our party decry the increasing militarization of the Reichsbanner. They say it is emulating the right-wing nationalists or the communists, and risks alienating our allies in the centrist parties. On the other hand, more left-leaning radicals are being lured to our organizations, away from the communists.

[? if historical_mode : The Center Party decries the militarization of the Reichsbanner, and its members are leaving the republican organization. ?]


@militant_2
view-if: funded_rfb >= 1
on-arrival: rb_militancy += 0.02; funded_rfb -= 1

As we have already funded resources towards the RFB, we can invest in building up their militancy.


@same

The RFB is already serving the purpose it needs to serve. There is no reason to change what already works.

- @return: Continue...


@cut_rfb
subtitle: +1 resources
on-arrival: resources += 1; rb_strength -= 100; rb_militancy -= 0.05; thalmannites_strength -= 2; thalmannites_dissent -= 2; ultras_strength += 3; ultras_dissent += 3; kpd_militancy -= 0.05; workers_spd += 2; unemployed_spd += 2

Cutting resources to the RFB causes a drop in the membership, and leads some would-be members to join the Reichsbanner and SPD instead.


@women_rfb
title: Integrate the Roter Frauen und Mädchen Bund, our women's only mass organization, into the RFB to bolster our defenses.
subtitle: -1 resources
view-if: zetkin_advisor == 1 and thalmannites_strength < conciliators_strength and antifa_formed == 1
choose-if: resources > 0
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rfb_militancy *= 0.85; rfb_strength += 400; women_in_rb = 1; rfb_militancy += 0.05 if repealed_175; rfb_militancy += 0.04 if trans_rights; rfb_militancy += 0.02 if reformed_183;
go-to: homosexual if trans_rights or repealed_175 or reformed_183
max-visits: 1
achievement: women_reichsbanner

The suggestion to allow women integrate the RFMB and allow women into the RFB is ridiculed by most, except for Clara Zetkin. But this is an exceptional time, and we need anyone who is willing to join. Thus, we organize specialized units for women, [? if homosexual_rights > 0: and even some covert units for transsexuals and homosexuals ?].

After allowing women to join, the number of comrades who leave is more than balanced out by the number of radicalized women and others who join. However, many of our departed members were veterans, and many of the new members have no experience with military-style training.

@homosexual
achievement: anders_als_die_andern
